  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "cadences-advanced-and-historical",
      "title": "Cadences — Advanced and Historical",
      "level": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Track:** theory | **Tier:** advanced | **Difficulty:** 7/10\n**Prerequisites:** Cadences — Applied\n**Tags:** cadences, baroque, jazz-turnaround"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Historical cadence types, **evaded** and **Phrygian** cadences, and jazz **turnarounds** as repeating cadential patterns."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "phrygian-half-cadence",
      "title": "Phrygian half cadence",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "In minor, ♭II–V (bass step down) — Baroque and some art song. Distinct sound from diatonic half cadence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "jazz-turnaround",
      "title": "Jazz turnaround",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "I–vi–ii–V–I cycle extends cadential energy — representative of hundreds of standards, not every standard individually."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "evaded-cadence",
      "title": "Evaded cadence",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Dominant resolves unexpectedly — analysis skill for Romantic repertoire."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
